   "@alexeldeib benched Matthew Stafford again, and this time Purdy made it look smart. The site owner is up four spots, so expect this page to get smug.",
   "Meanwhile the power rankings put two losing teams on the podium and the league's only unbeaten team fifth. The rankings and the standings are no longer on speaking terms."
